91	// hostedSyncOnPushHint uploads the fact store on a push hint: the hinted
92	// branch, then the default branch, throttled by a shared marker. It
93	// deliberately does NOT distill — the hint is an upload beat for facts that
94	// already exist. Fact creation stays on the session-end hook and the daemon
95	// tick until it moves into the memory worker with the session-end deprecation.
96	// The marker is claimed BEFORE the work so concurrent notify processes skip
97	// instead of stampeding; a failed run after the claim simply waits out the
98	// interval, which the never-fails contract already tolerates.
